## C0009 -- a branch on a secret value (timing leak).
## command: lume check   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; C0009_secret_branch.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: compute without branching on the secret, as ct_eq does
fn ct_bad_compare(secret_tag: int, guess: int) -> int = if secret_tag == guess then 1 else 0
print 0
